spin attack have looked more balanced this season, and players like Sunil Narine and Andre Russell can turn the match around within a few overs. Delhi Capitals also have dangerous players in their squad, but based on recent form and home conditions, KKR are predicted to win today’s match.KKR vs DC IPL 2026 Match Time TodayThe KKR vs DC IPL 2026 match will be played today at Eden Gardens. The exciting clash is expected to begin at 7:30 PM IST, while the toss will take place 30 minutes before the match. Fans can enjoy another thrilling evening of IPL action in Kolkata.","keywords":"KKR vs DC Live Score IPL 2026","wordCount":353,"timeRequired":"PT2M","inLanguage":"en-IN","isAccessibleForFree":true,"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#website"},"audience":{"@type":"Audience","geographicArea":{"@type":"Country","name":"India","sameAs":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q668"}},"reviewedBy":{"@type":"Person","name":"Prasant Bagriya","jobTitle":"Editorial Reviewer"},"about":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"General"}],"mentions":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"KKR vs DC Live Score IPL 2026"}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/kkr-vs-dc-live-score#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://chatwizs.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"General","item":"https://chatwizs.com/category/general"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"KKR vs DC Live Score IPL 2026: Kolkata Knight Riders vs Delhi Capitals – Eden Gardens, May 24","item":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/kkr-vs-dc-live-score"}]}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"itemScope":true,"itemType":"https://schema.org/BlogPosting","style":{"width":"100%","maxWidth":"1200px","margin":"0 auto"},"children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","link",null,{"rel":"preload","as":"image","href":"/uploads/media-1779701410375-694356129.jpeg","fetchPriority":"high","imageSizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","imageSrcSet":"/uploads/media-17797014103